{25\\pi }{12}+n\\pi  \\\\ x & =\\frac{25\\pi }{24}+\\frac{n\\pi }{2} \\\\ x & =\\frac{(12n+25)\\pi }{24}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe set $n=0,\\pm 1,\\pm 2,…,$ until we have generated all solutions in the domain $0\\le x<\\pi .$\n\n- Setting $n=-2$ gives $x=\\frac{\\pi }{24}$\n\n- Setting $n=-1$ gives $x=\\frac{13\\pi }{24}$\n\nAll other values of $n$ generate solutions outside the domain $0\\le x<\\pi .$ So, the solutions are $x=\\frac{\\pi }{24},\\frac{13\\pi }{24}.$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=\\frac{\\pi }{24}\\cdot \\frac{13\\pi }{24}=\\frac{13{\\pi }^{2}}{576}.\n$$" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283643 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283644 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283645 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283646 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283647 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1041 "selection" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283645 13194139534333 true] [17592186283642 1110 #uuid "2d7164eb-5953-58f0-bc2e-73f0a8967b7c" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283643 1034 "\\frac{13\\pi }{576}" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283643 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534333 true] [17592186283643 1111 #uuid "a3689f59-a2f5-536c-a227-47176b889a9b" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283644 1034 "-\\frac{13{\\pi }^{2}}{576}" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283644 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534333 true] [17592186283644 1111 #uuid "8993e47e-f568-547a-ab5b-823258203bbd" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283645 1034 "\\frac{13{\\pi }^{2}}{576}" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283645 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534333 true] [17592186283645 1111 #uuid "926b7e8a-c99b-5e5d-b545-4cc5f7c706d7" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283646 1034 "-\\frac{13{\\pi }^{2}}{24}" 13194139534333 true] [17592186283646 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 131